# The suffix of the markers of a numbering (reference/components/list.md#markers). Page of 595 × 300 with margins of
# 40: page area of 515 × 220 from (40, 40). Lines of 12 (Size 10) and characters of 5, so "a) " and "9. " measure 15
# and "10) " and "10. ", 20.
#
# The indent of the lists is their left Padding of 30, declared in Styles. clauses numbers in letters with a
# parenthesis: its markers end at x = 70, where its items start. sub, nested in c2, declares no Marker suffix and
# keeps the period: the suffix of a list is not that of the lists inside it. md is a Markdown whose list is written
# with 9): it takes the parenthesis from there, with the Marker of Number markers.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 595
		Height: 300
		Margin: 40
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
		For element: List
			Box:
				Padding: 0 0 0 30
	Section:
		List:
			Id: clauses
			Marker: lower-alpha
			Marker suffix: parenthesis
			List item:
				Id: c1
				Text: Objeto del contrato
			List item:
				Id: c2
				Text: Duración
				List:
					Id: sub
					Marker: decimal
					First number: 9
					List item:
						Id: s1
						Text: Prórroga
					List item:
						Id: s2
						Text: Renuncia
		Markdown:
			Id: md
			Number markers: decimal
			Content >>
				9) Pago
				10) Impago
